   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Pack: an app as files: tables, moves, rules, tests\nMove: one named action, run as one SQL statement\nRule: a yes or no check a move must pass first\nEffect: a move that sends something out; needs a person's yes\nAgent: acts for one person, never with more rights than theirs\nRow rules: the database hides rows of brands you can't reach",
   "originalText": "Pack: an app as files: tables, moves, rules, tests\nMove: one named action, run as one SQL statement\nRule: a yes or no check a move must pass first\nEffect: a move that sends something out; needs a person's yes\nAgent: acts for one person, never with more rights than theirs\nRow rules: the database hides rows of brands you can't reach",
